Gladiator. Global PvE. gladiator-overhead. Alternative: use a ring you already own. Choose one observed random-line ring and work only on that ring:
{ringPlan}
Open Enhancement → Soul Binding → Sync, select the unwanted line on the chosen ring, and add a Sync Stone or material the current window accepts. Inspect consumption, success chance and the skill pool before rolling for Overhead Slam +1. Set a Kina/material spending limit first. Stop when it lands or when that limit is reached; success is not guaranteed within your budget. Sync changes one selected line and consumes its material; it does not guarantee the target skill. Reset changes every line. Bind raises existing values and does not turn Flight Power into Overhead Slam. Inventory and Kina are not visible to the helper.
